Changes made for this app: retained Spanish headwords having at least one gloss;
consolidated headwords that normalize to the same lowercase, accent-insensitive
key; retained up to eight glosses per normalized headword; removed empty and
oversized gloss values, compacted whitespace, stripped simple template markup,
and stored the result as sorted UTF-8 TSV compressed with gzip. The asset is
intended for exact-match offline lookup. No network access is used at runtime.
